<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VTEL cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VTEL cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it downgraded VTEL Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- VTEL dropped 3/8 to 7-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
